WEBVTT

00:07.793 --> 00:09.068
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.137 --> 00:10.758
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.827 --> 00:12.241
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.310 --> 00:14.413
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.482 --> 00:17.275
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.344 --> 00:19.344
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.413 --> 00:21.344
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.413 --> 00:23.241
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.310 --> 00:24.931
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.000 --> 00:27.379
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.448 --> 00:29.379
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.448 --> 00:31.310
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.379 --> 00:33.344
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.413 --> 00:35.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.275 --> 00:37.551
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.620 --> 00:39.482
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.551 --> 00:40.793
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.862 --> 00:42.655
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.724 --> 00:45.413
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.482 --> 00:47.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.655 --> 00:48.896
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.724 --> 00:54.655
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

00:54.724 --> 01:00.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:00.862 --> 01:05.137
[calming music]
[平静的音乐]

01:05.206 --> 01:07.931
- Greetings,
children of Bikini Bottom.
- 问候，
比基尼泳裤的孩子们。

01:08.000 --> 01:11.758
I am Karen,
the computer fairy.
我是凯伦，
电脑仙子。

01:11.827 --> 01:15.655
[singing opera]
【唱戏】

01:15.724 --> 01:20.206
And I have a magical
tale to tell.
而我有一个神奇的
故事要讲。

01:20.275 --> 01:24.379
Once upon a time,
there was a dim-witted sea star
曾几何时，
有一颗愚笨的海星

01:24.448 --> 01:29.068
who was about to stuff
his fat face.
谁正要塞东西
他那张肥胖的脸。

01:29.137 --> 01:30.413
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:30.482 --> 01:33.241
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

01:33.310 --> 01:35.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:35.103 --> 01:37.517
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:37.586 --> 01:38.793
- [laughs]
- [笑]

01:38.862 --> 01:41.482
That idiot has such a huge
pile of patties.
那个白痴竟然有这么大的力气
一堆肉饼。

01:41.551 --> 01:44.620
I don't think he'll notice
if one walks away.
我认为他不会注意到
如果一个人走开。

01:44.689 --> 01:45.689
[laughs]
[笑]

01:45.758 --> 01:47.793
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

01:49.241 --> 01:51.689
Aww, I need more ketchup.
哇，我需要更多番茄酱。

01:51.758 --> 01:52.793
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:55.034 --> 01:57.172
- Hmm, which patty to choose?
- 嗯，选择哪个肉饼？

01:57.241 --> 01:58.862
This one?
Nope, too small.
这个？
不行，太小了。

01:58.931 --> 02:00.551
This one?
Nope, been chewed.
这个？
不，被嚼烂了。

02:00.620 --> 02:02.689
This one?
Nope, the seeds are missing.
这个？
不，种子不见了。

02:02.758 --> 02:04.758
Hmm.
唔。

02:04.827 --> 02:06.620
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:08.758 --> 02:10.896
[screams]
[尖叫声]

02:10.965 --> 02:12.137
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:12.206 --> 02:15.586
- [groans]
Stand up, you moron!
- [呻吟]
站起来，你这个白痴！

02:15.655 --> 02:18.517
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

02:18.586 --> 02:20.620
- Get me an ice pack,
you idiot!
- 给我一个冰袋，
你这个白痴！

02:20.689 --> 02:23.931
- Where are you, voice?
Where are you?
- 你在哪里，声音？
你在哪里？

02:24.000 --> 02:25.655
- Uh, Patrick?
- [shouts]
- 呃，帕特里克？
- [喊叫]

02:25.724 --> 02:27.965
Oh, it's you, SpongeBob.
哦，是你，海绵宝宝。

02:28.034 --> 02:32.000
I thought you were this crazy
voice that keeps telling me
我以为你这么疯狂
不断告诉我的声音

02:32.068 --> 02:33.310
what to do.
该怎么办。

02:33.379 --> 02:35.344
- Oh, that's probably
your conscience.
-哦，这可能是
你的良心。

02:35.413 --> 02:38.068
- What are "conscience"?
Are they bad?
- 什么是“良心”？
他们坏吗？

02:38.137 --> 02:41.068
- No, a conscience is a tiny
voice inside you
- 不，良心很小
你内心的声音

02:41.137 --> 02:43.620
that tells you the difference
between something that's right
这告诉你区别
在正确的事情之间

02:43.689 --> 02:45.344
and something--
- [groans]
还有一些东西——
- [呻吟]

02:45.413 --> 02:46.793
- That's wrong.
- Hmm.
- 那是错误的。
- 唔。

02:46.862 --> 02:50.724
So I should do what the voice
tells me to do?
所以我应该做那个声音
告诉我做什么？

02:50.793 --> 02:53.517
- Now that's a smart little
sea star.
- 现在这是一个聪明的小家伙
海星。

02:53.586 --> 02:54.620
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:54.689 --> 02:58.000
[chewing]
[咀嚼]

02:58.068 --> 03:00.275
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

03:00.344 --> 03:02.068
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

03:02.137 --> 03:03.517
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:03.586 --> 03:07.206
Patrick, this is your
conscience speaking.
帕特里克，这是你的
良心说话。

03:07.275 --> 03:08.517
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:08.586 --> 03:12.000
Oh, nice to meet you,
conscience.
哦，很高兴认识你，
良心。

03:12.068 --> 03:14.310
- So stupid.
- 太蠢了。

03:14.379 --> 03:17.758
So, stupid, the first thing
you need to do is buy some more
所以，笨蛋，第一件事
你需要做的就是多买一些

03:17.827 --> 03:21.310
Krabby Patties on the double.
Hi-ya, hey-o!
双份蟹蟹肉饼。
嗨呀，嘿哦！

03:21.379 --> 03:24.931
- That'll be the first thing
I do, conscience.
- 这将是第一件事
我愿意，良心。

03:25.000 --> 03:26.206
- Yes!
- 是的！

03:26.275 --> 03:27.931
- Right after
I run some errands.
- 就在之后
我办一些事。

03:28.000 --> 03:29.689
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

03:29.758 --> 03:32.103
[groans]
- Huh?
[呻吟]
- 啊？

03:32.172 --> 03:33.655
No!
[grunts]
不！
[咕哝]

03:33.724 --> 03:37.310
I'm calling the shots here.
Now get that Krabby Patty.
我在这里发号施令。
现在去拿蟹肉饼吧。

03:37.379 --> 03:42.206
- It's just a little list!
Please, conscience?
- 这只是一个小清单！
请问，良心吗？

03:42.275 --> 03:46.103
- All right, pea brain.
Make it quick.
- 好吧，豌豆脑。
快点吧。

03:46.172 --> 03:50.068
- Number one:
high-five everyone!
- 第一：
大家高五！

03:50.137 --> 03:52.931
Huh!
- No, put me down first!
哈！
- 不，先把我放下！

03:53.000 --> 03:54.241
Ow!
- High five!
噢！
- 高五！

03:54.310 --> 03:55.413
High five!
- [screams]
高五！
- [尖叫]

03:55.482 --> 03:57.620
- Low five!
- [screams]
- 低五！
- [尖叫]

03:57.689 --> 03:59.000
- High five!
- [groans]
- 高五！
- [呻吟]

03:59.068 --> 04:00.448
- High five!
- [screams]
- 高五！
- [尖叫]

04:00.517 --> 04:02.172
- High five!
- Ow!
- 高五！
- 噢！

04:02.241 --> 04:03.241
- High five!
- [groans]
- 高五！
- [呻吟]

04:03.310 --> 04:04.275
- High five!
- Ow!
- 高五！
- 噢！

04:04.344 --> 04:06.793
[moaning]
[呻吟]

04:06.862 --> 04:08.000
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:08.068 --> 04:10.241
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

04:10.310 --> 04:13.241
[ragtime piano music]
[拉格泰姆钢琴曲]

04:13.310 --> 04:16.137
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:16.206 --> 04:19.827
Number two:
Ice cream!
第二：
冰淇淋！

04:19.896 --> 04:22.517
Yeah!
[waggles tongue]
是的！
[摇摆舌头]

04:22.586 --> 04:26.137
One Double Chocolate
Molar Blowout, please.
一份双份巧克力
臼齿喷发，请。

04:26.206 --> 04:29.517
- One Molar Blowout,
coming up!
- 一颗磨牙爆裂，
来了！

04:29.586 --> 04:35.000
- No! You hate ice cream.
You only want Krabby Patties.
- 不！你讨厌冰淇淋。
你只想要蟹肉饼。

04:35.068 --> 04:36.724
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:36.793 --> 04:39.482
Hey, you!
Cancel that order!
嘿，你！
取消该订单！

04:39.551 --> 04:41.689
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:41.758 --> 04:44.931
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

04:45.000 --> 04:46.482
- [grunts]
- [shouts]
- [咕哝]
- [喊叫]

04:46.551 --> 04:47.620
Ow!
噢！

04:47.689 --> 04:51.275
You hate high fives
and ice cream?
你讨厌击掌
还有冰淇淋？

04:51.344 --> 04:53.241
Are you sure
you're my conscience?
你确定吗
你是我的良心吗？

04:53.310 --> 04:59.137
- Uh, uh, I, uh--I'm absolutely
positively your conscience.
- 呃，呃，我，呃——我绝对
积极地你的良心。

04:59.206 --> 05:00.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:00.896 --> 05:05.310
- Hey, doesn't your nose grow
when you tell lies
- 嘿，你的鼻子没长吗
当你说谎时

05:05.379 --> 05:07.586
in fairy tales?
- Nope.
童话故事里？
- 没有。

05:07.655 --> 05:10.413
Noses only grow when
you make up the truth.
鼻子只有在以下情况下才会生长
你编造了事实。

05:10.482 --> 05:12.206
- Ooh.
- See?
- 哦。
- 看？

05:12.275 --> 05:17.275
- [laughs]
I wanna make up the truth too!
- [笑]
我也想编造真相！

05:17.344 --> 05:22.482
Uh, I ate a hot air balloon
for breakfast.
呃，我吃了一个热气球
早餐。

05:22.551 --> 05:25.000
Mm.
I-I mean, um...
毫米。
我-我是说，嗯...

05:25.068 --> 05:30.758
I did not eat a hot air balloon
for breakfast.
我没有吃热气球
早餐。

05:30.827 --> 05:36.689
Hey, I got a big nose too!
Nose fight!
嘿嘿，我也有一个大鼻子！
鼻子大战！

05:36.758 --> 05:39.103
En garde!
- [screaming]
准备好了！
- [尖叫]

05:39.172 --> 05:41.068
[grunts]
- Hey!
[咕哝]
- 嘿！

05:41.137 --> 05:43.896
[both grunting]
[cheering]
[两人都咕哝着]
[欢呼]

05:49.448 --> 05:52.482
- Hooray!
[cheering]
- 万岁！
[欢呼]

05:52.551 --> 05:55.793
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

05:58.068 --> 05:59.275
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

06:02.068 --> 06:03.586
all: Uh-oh.
全体：呃哦。

06:03.655 --> 06:06.793
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

06:06.862 --> 06:08.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:08.551 --> 06:10.068
both: Sorry.
两人：抱歉。

06:10.137 --> 06:12.551
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

06:12.620 --> 06:15.068
[both shouting and groaning]
[尖叫和呻吟]

06:15.137 --> 06:18.172
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

06:18.241 --> 06:21.137
- Time to let your conscience
be your guide.
- 是时候让你的良心
成为你的向导。

06:21.206 --> 06:22.655
Give me that list!
把那个清单给我！

06:22.724 --> 06:24.034
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:24.103 --> 06:26.896
[mutters]
[嘀咕]

06:26.965 --> 06:31.724
Here.
- Hey, only one errand left.
这里。
- 嘿，只剩下一项任务了。

06:31.793 --> 06:36.275
Gotta give a Plankton
a Krabby Patty!
必须给一个浮游生物
蟹肉饼！

06:36.344 --> 06:40.965
- ♪ Oh, yeah! ♪
- ♪ 哦，是的！ ♪

06:41.034 --> 06:42.655
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

06:42.724 --> 06:45.551
- Wonder why I wanted to give
Plankton a patty?
- 想知道为什么我想给予
浮游生物是肉饼吗？

06:45.620 --> 06:49.034
- Why not Plankton?
He's a sweetheart.
- 为什么不是浮游生物？
他是个甜心。

06:49.103 --> 06:50.655
Huh?
[grunts]
啊？
[咕哝]

06:50.724 --> 06:53.827
And as your conscience,
I demand you toss that patty
作为你的良心，
我要求你扔掉那块肉饼

06:53.896 --> 06:55.758
in the mail slot!
在邮件槽中！

06:55.827 --> 06:58.793
- Ooh, I love mail slot toss!
- 哦，我喜欢投掷邮件槽！

06:58.862 --> 07:01.034
Hmm!
唔！

07:01.103 --> 07:03.172
- Not so hard!
Hmm?
- 没那么难！
唔？

07:03.241 --> 07:04.689
Mm!
毫米！

07:04.758 --> 07:07.379
- I've been wanting to hit
the beach all week.
-我一直想打
整个星期都在海滩。

07:07.448 --> 07:09.827
[laughs]
all: Goo Lagoon!
[笑]
所有人：古泻湖！

07:09.896 --> 07:12.482
Goo Lagoon!
- Huh?
古泻湖！
- 啊？

07:12.551 --> 07:14.965
[groans]
Huh?
[呻吟]
啊？

07:15.034 --> 07:16.758
Ah!
啊!

07:16.827 --> 07:20.379
Patrick, please promptly pursue
Plankton's patty.
帕特里克，请速追
浮游生物的肉饼。

07:20.448 --> 07:22.103
Get the idea?
明白了吗？

07:22.172 --> 07:25.172
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

07:29.034 --> 07:30.551
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:30.620 --> 07:33.379
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

07:33.448 --> 07:36.620
How many planktons does it take
to change a light bulb?
需要多少浮游生物
换灯泡？

07:36.689 --> 07:39.000
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

07:39.068 --> 07:40.689
One.
一。

07:40.758 --> 07:43.413
- Oh, now I get the idea!
- 哦，现在我明白了！

07:43.482 --> 07:46.551
♪ Ooh, gotta follow
that patty! ♪
♪ 哦，必须跟随
那个小馅饼！ ♪

07:46.620 --> 07:49.206
- [screams]
Ouch!
- [尖叫]
哎哟！

07:49.275 --> 07:52.000
Wait for me,
you pink pinhead!
等我，
你这个粉红色的小傻瓜！

07:52.068 --> 07:53.655
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:53.724 --> 07:57.310
[surf rock music]
[冲浪摇滚音乐]

07:57.379 --> 07:59.379
- Mmm.
- 嗯。

07:59.448 --> 08:02.172
- Ow.
- Ow!
- 噢。
- 噢！

08:02.241 --> 08:03.379
Hey, watch it!
嘿，注意看！

08:03.448 --> 08:04.896
- Ow!
- [burps]
- 噢！
- [打嗝]

08:04.965 --> 08:06.241
Huh?
啊？

08:06.310 --> 08:08.448
- [spitting]
- [随地吐痰]

08:08.517 --> 08:10.103
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

08:10.172 --> 08:13.310
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

08:13.379 --> 08:14.620
- There's blubber mouth.
- 有一张鲸脂嘴。

08:14.689 --> 08:16.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:16.241 --> 08:18.448
[gulps]
[吞咽]

08:18.517 --> 08:21.655
- There's Plankton's patty!
- 这是 Plankton 的肉饼！

08:21.724 --> 08:24.379
- You know what to do.
- Do I?
- 你知道该怎么做。
- 我是吗？

08:24.448 --> 08:25.413
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:25.482 --> 08:28.344
Oh, yeah!
- [groans]
哦，是啊！
- [呻吟]

08:28.413 --> 08:32.275
[grunts]
[shouting]
[咕哝]
[喊叫]

08:32.344 --> 08:34.206
Huh?
[shouting]
啊？
[喊叫]

08:34.275 --> 08:35.862
Whoa!
[groans]
哇！
[呻吟]

08:35.931 --> 08:38.413
[moans]
Oh, well.
[呻吟声]
哦，好吧。

08:38.482 --> 08:43.241
No patty for Plankton.
[cries]
浮游生物没有肉饼。
[哭声]

08:43.310 --> 08:45.034
- [grunts]
I'm going in!
- [咕哝]
我要进去了！

08:45.103 --> 08:47.586
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:47.655 --> 08:49.931
- Ugh, just being near
a whale's mouth
- 呃，只是靠近而已
鲸鱼的嘴

08:50.000 --> 08:51.896
gives me the creeps.
- [grunts]
让我毛骨悚然。
- [咕哝]

08:51.965 --> 08:52.896
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

08:52.965 --> 08:55.482
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:55.551 --> 08:59.068
- Quiet, you fool!
You'll wake up Pearl.
- 安静，你这个傻瓜！
你会叫醒珀尔的。

08:59.137 --> 09:00.379
- [screams quietly]
- [小声尖叫]

09:00.448 --> 09:01.793
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:01.862 --> 09:05.379
- [gulps]
[snores]
- [吞咽]
[打鼾]

09:05.448 --> 09:08.896
- [groans]
This is snug.
- [呻吟]
这很舒服。

09:08.965 --> 09:11.551
- Mother always said I'd end up
in a whale's belly.
- 妈妈总是说我会结束
在鲸鱼的肚子里。

09:11.620 --> 09:14.827
Or prison.
- Hey, who-a goes-a there?
或者监狱。
- 嘿，谁去那里？

09:14.896 --> 09:17.482
- Who goes where?
- The name's a-Geppetto.
- 谁去哪里？
- 名字是a-Geppetto。

09:17.551 --> 09:19.310
Take off your hats.
Stay a while.
摘下你的帽子。
停留一会儿。

09:19.379 --> 09:21.655
- We don't have time
for a visit, old man.
- 我们没有时间
来拜访一下，老人。

09:21.724 --> 09:23.931
We're just trying to find
our sandwich!
我们只是想找到
我们的三明治！

09:24.000 --> 09:25.448
- Sandwich?
- 三明治？

09:25.517 --> 09:27.620
No, I haven't seen
anything like that
不，我还没见过
类似的事情

09:27.689 --> 09:29.448
around here in months.
[chuckles]
几个月后就到这里了。
[笑声]

09:29.517 --> 09:31.172
Huh?
[chuckles]
啊？
[笑声]

09:31.241 --> 09:34.655
- Hey, Geppetto,
what's that behind your back?
- 嘿，杰佩托，
你背后那是什么？

09:34.724 --> 09:37.172
- Is that our Krabby Patty?
- Nope.
- 那是我们的蟹黄饼吗？
- 没有。

09:37.241 --> 09:38.620
Oh!
[grunts]
哦！
[咕哝]

09:38.689 --> 09:40.896
- [grunts]
Aha!
- [咕哝]
啊哈！

09:40.965 --> 09:43.724
I got the patty!
- Aha!
我拿到了肉饼！
- 啊哈！

09:43.793 --> 09:45.724
I got the wig!
我拿到假发了！

09:45.793 --> 09:47.896
- Son, they're-a stealing
our food-a!
- 儿子，他们是偷东西
我们的食物-a！

09:47.965 --> 09:49.689
- Who's stealing our food, Pop?
- 谁在偷我们的食物，爸爸？

09:49.758 --> 09:51.827
Let me at 'em, let me at 'em!
让我对付他们，让我对付他们！

09:51.896 --> 09:53.482
- Get him, Pinocchio!
- 抓住他，匹诺曹！

09:53.551 --> 09:56.793
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

10:00.551 --> 10:03.482
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:03.551 --> 10:04.827
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

10:04.896 --> 10:09.068
- Oh, no.
A stomachache at the beach?
- 哦，不。
去海边肚子疼？

10:09.137 --> 10:13.620
That's no fun.
I wish it would go away.
那没什么好玩的。
我希望它会消失。

10:13.689 --> 10:17.241
Hmm?
- Your wish is granted.
唔？
- 你的愿望实现了。

10:17.310 --> 10:19.068
Hold out your hand.
伸出你的手。

10:19.137 --> 10:20.551
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

10:20.620 --> 10:23.793
- Wow!
What is this?
- 哇！
这是什么？

10:23.862 --> 10:26.000
- For fast relief
of indigestion,
- 快速缓解
消化不良，

10:26.068 --> 10:30.827
try Gush and Flush and wash
your pain down the drain.
尝试喷水、冲水和清洗
你的痛苦付之东流。

10:30.896 --> 10:33.793
And my stupid husband,
while you're at it.
还有我愚蠢的丈夫，
当你在做的时候。

10:33.862 --> 10:35.448
- [gulps]
Ah.
- [吞咽]
啊。

10:35.517 --> 10:36.448
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:36.517 --> 10:40.379
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

10:40.448 --> 10:42.517
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:42.586 --> 10:45.344
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:45.413 --> 10:49.241
- Thank you,
extra-strength Gush and Flush!
- Thank you,
超强力喷涌和冲洗！

10:49.310 --> 10:51.000
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

10:51.068 --> 10:55.655
- Pinocchio, we're-a free-a!
♪ Yeah! ♪
- 匹诺曹，我们是自由人！
♪ 是啊！ ♪

10:55.724 --> 10:56.965
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

10:58.448 --> 10:59.724
- Huh?
[giggles]
- 啊？
[咯咯笑]

10:59.793 --> 11:01.827
Don't worry about the patty,
Patrick.
不用担心肉饼的问题
帕特里克.

11:01.896 --> 11:03.896
I'll take it
to Plankton myself,
我会接受的
对浮游生物本人来说，

11:03.965 --> 11:07.241
like a good little conscience.
See you.
就像一个善良的小良心。
再见。

11:07.310 --> 11:09.689
[giggles]
[grunts]
[咯咯笑]
[咕哝]

11:09.758 --> 11:12.620
- Oh, hey, Patrick.
- [grunts]
- 哦，嘿，帕特里克。
- [咕哝]

11:12.689 --> 11:15.620
My conscience?
- You are?
我的良心？
- 你是？

11:15.689 --> 11:17.586
- Yep, I'm Patrick's
conscience.
- 是的，我是帕特里克的
良心。

11:17.655 --> 11:19.275
But I overslept.
但我睡过头了。

11:19.344 --> 11:22.793
- Well, if you're my
conscience, Conscience,
- 好吧，如果你是我的
良心，良心，

11:22.862 --> 11:25.482
then who's that?
- It's a bug!
那么那是谁呢？
- 这是一个错误！

11:25.551 --> 11:29.689
Step on it!
- [groaning]
踩它！
- [呻吟]

11:29.758 --> 11:33.551
- And they all lived
happily ever after.
- 他们都活着
从此幸福快乐。

11:33.620 --> 11:36.068
So until next time,
this is--
所以直到下一次，
这是——

11:36.137 --> 11:39.137
- Karen!
- The computer fairy,
- 凯伦！
- 电脑仙子，

11:39.206 --> 11:42.206
hoping all your dreams
come true.
希望你所有的梦想
成真。

11:42.275 --> 11:43.275
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

11:44.862 --> 11:46.206
- Let me at 'em, Pop.
Let me at 'em.
- 让我来对付他们吧，爸爸。
让我来对付他们。

11:46.275 --> 11:47.689
Let me at 'em, let me--
aww!
让我对付他们，让我——
哇！

11:50.931 --> 11:53.793
[swashbuckling music]
[虚张声势的音乐]

11:53.862 --> 12:00.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:00.137 --> 12:03.344
[accordion music]
[手风琴音乐]

12:03.413 --> 12:05.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:05.551 --> 12:09.275
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

12:13.620 --> 12:18.586
You people are proof that
evolution can go in reverse!
你们就是证明
进化可以逆转！

12:18.655 --> 12:20.517
all: [shushing]
全体：[嘘]

12:20.586 --> 12:23.689
- [humming "Entrance
of the Gladiators"]
- [哼哼“入口
角斗士”]

12:23.758 --> 12:25.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:25.758 --> 12:29.379
Pew! Pew! Pew!
座位！座位！座位！

12:29.448 --> 12:30.965
all: [oohing]
全体：[噢]

12:31.034 --> 12:35.310
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

12:40.000 --> 12:41.586
♪ Ta-da! ♪
♪ 哒哒！ ♪

12:41.655 --> 12:44.241
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

12:44.310 --> 12:46.827
- Mr. Squidward,
why aren't these walking
- 章鱼哥先生
为什么这些人不走路

12:46.896 --> 12:49.862
wallets spending money?
- [grunts]
钱包花钱？
- [咕哝]

12:49.931 --> 12:53.965
Because they're too busy
watching SpongeBob cook.
因为他们太忙了
看海绵宝宝做饭。

12:54.034 --> 12:56.655
- What?
- Ow!
- 什么？
- 噢！

12:56.724 --> 12:58.517
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

12:58.586 --> 13:00.551
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

13:00.620 --> 13:03.517
- Well, he's not exactly
maximerizing his work time
- 嗯，他不完全是
最大限度地利用他的工作时间

13:03.586 --> 13:04.862
with those flourishes.
与那些繁荣。

13:04.931 --> 13:08.827
But boy, does that boyo
have talent.
但是男孩，那个男孩吗？
有才华。

13:08.896 --> 13:10.758
[cheerful noises]
[欢快的声音]

13:10.827 --> 13:12.448
[grunts]
[咕哝]

13:12.517 --> 13:15.241
And talent is worth money.
人才是值钱的。

13:15.310 --> 13:19.482
[shouting]
[all scream]
[喊叫]
[所有人尖叫]

13:19.551 --> 13:20.586
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

13:20.655 --> 13:24.965
- [singing]
- [唱歌]

13:25.034 --> 13:26.275
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

13:26.344 --> 13:28.689
[confused noises]
I have X-ray vision!
[混乱的声音]
我有X光视力！

13:28.758 --> 13:30.965
I can see through walls.
我可以透过墙壁看到。

13:31.034 --> 13:33.965
- Calm your waters, lad.
I just knocked it down.
- 冷静点，小伙子。
我刚刚把它打倒了。

13:34.034 --> 13:37.413
- I--why'd you do that?
- 我--你为什么这么做？

13:37.482 --> 13:41.379
- In the restaurant business,
it's called an open kitchen,
- 在餐饮业，
这就是所谓的开放式厨房，

13:41.448 --> 13:45.034
so the customers can watch
the cook cook.
这样顾客就可以观看
厨师做饭。

13:45.103 --> 13:46.482
- Oh, Mr. Krabs,
I don't know if I can take
-哦，蟹老板先生，
我不知道我是否可以接受

13:46.551 --> 13:48.827
that kind of pressure.
- Nonsense.
那种压力。
- 废话。

13:48.896 --> 13:52.793
You're a born performer.
Ooh.
你是一个天生的表演者。
哦。

13:52.862 --> 13:54.862
Here.
[grunts and spits]
这里。
[咕哝和吐口水]

13:54.931 --> 13:56.482
[marker squeaking]
[标记吱吱作响]

13:56.551 --> 13:59.379
You've even got
your own dressing room.
你甚至还拥有
你自己的更衣室。

13:59.448 --> 14:02.551
Huh? Huh? Huh?
啊？啊？啊？

14:02.620 --> 14:04.172
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

14:04.241 --> 14:06.517
[shouts]
- [moans]
[喊叫]
- [呻吟]

14:06.586 --> 14:10.448
[groans]
Come on, boyo, it's showtime.
[呻吟]
来吧，男孩，表演时间到了。

14:10.517 --> 14:11.655
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

14:11.724 --> 14:13.586
- [groans]
I can't.
- [呻吟]
我不能。

14:13.655 --> 14:15.482
I've got stage fright.
我怯场了。

14:15.551 --> 14:20.551
- SpongeBob, if you don't
come out, you're fired.
- 海绵宝宝，如果你不这样做
出来吧，你被解雇了。

14:20.620 --> 14:23.172
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

14:23.241 --> 14:26.965
- There he is!
- [grunts]
- 他在那儿！
- [咕哝]

14:27.034 --> 14:29.724
- Chef Bob!
- 厨师鲍勃！

14:29.793 --> 14:32.379
Me little star!
我的小星星！

14:32.448 --> 14:35.620
Break a leg.
Break two legs.
打断一条腿。
打断两条腿。

14:35.689 --> 14:37.931
- My leg!
- Shut up, Fred.
- 我的腿！
- 闭嘴，弗雷德。

14:38.000 --> 14:40.827
[singing]
[歌唱]

14:40.896 --> 14:44.103
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

14:45.517 --> 14:48.000
all: [oohing]
全体：[噢]

14:48.068 --> 14:49.862
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

14:49.931 --> 14:53.655
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

14:53.724 --> 14:54.793
- What?
- 什么？

14:54.862 --> 14:56.793
- [giggles nervously]
- [紧张地咯咯笑]

14:56.862 --> 14:57.862
- That's just wrong!
- 那是错误的！

14:57.931 --> 14:59.413
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

15:02.103 --> 15:05.344
- Come on, boyo,
razzle-dazzle them!
- 来吧，男孩，
让他们眼花缭乱！

15:05.413 --> 15:07.206
- [groans]
- Huh?
- [呻吟]
- 啊？

15:07.275 --> 15:09.517
- Oh, what do I do?
What do I do?
- 哦，我该怎么办？
我该怎么办？

15:09.586 --> 15:11.758
Huh?
Oh.
啊？
哦。

15:11.827 --> 15:14.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:14.793 --> 15:16.827
- [groans]
Hmm?
- [呻吟]
嗯？

15:16.896 --> 15:18.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:18.586 --> 15:19.965
[cheering]
[欢呼]

15:20.034 --> 15:22.689
- Hi, everybody!
Who's hungry?
- 大家好！
谁饿了？

15:22.758 --> 15:24.689
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

15:24.758 --> 15:26.379
- I guess I am.
- 我想我是。

15:26.448 --> 15:30.310
- Welcome, welcome to my job
in the kitchen of Chef Bob.
- 欢迎，欢迎来到我的工作岗位
在鲍勃厨师的厨房里。

15:30.379 --> 15:32.379
I cook and dance,
I wear square pants,
我一边做饭一边跳舞
我穿的是四角裤

15:32.448 --> 15:34.275
cooking for this hungry mob.
为这群饥饿的暴民做饭。

15:34.344 --> 15:38.827
♪ Your order, please! ♪
♪ 请您下单！ ♪

15:38.896 --> 15:42.206
[cheering]
[欢呼]

15:42.275 --> 15:45.517
- The little Chef Bob
is a sensation.
- 小厨师鲍勃
是一种感觉。

15:45.586 --> 15:47.517
[showy music]
[华丽的音乐]

15:47.586 --> 15:49.655
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

15:49.724 --> 15:53.137
[murmuring]
[淙淙]

15:53.206 --> 15:57.758
- Hi, everybody!
Who's hungry?
- 大家好！
谁饿了？

15:57.827 --> 15:59.206
all: We are!
全体：我们是！

15:59.275 --> 16:02.620
- Yay!
[goofy noises]
- 耶！
[愚蠢的声音]

16:02.689 --> 16:06.724
[cheering]
[欢呼]

16:06.793 --> 16:09.758
Yah!
Yah!
啊！
啊！

16:09.827 --> 16:11.862
- [laughing]
- [笑]

16:11.931 --> 16:16.103
- Ah!
Huh? Huh?
- 啊！
啊？啊？

16:16.172 --> 16:18.689
[goofy noises]
- [elated screaming]
[愚蠢的声音]
- [兴高采烈的尖叫]

16:18.758 --> 16:19.931
- Voila!
- 瞧！

16:20.000 --> 16:22.206
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

16:22.275 --> 16:24.172
♪ Ta-da! ♪
♪ 哒哒！ ♪

16:24.241 --> 16:26.344
[watch beeping]
- Oh, look at the time.
[注意蜂鸣声]
- 哦，看看时间。

16:26.413 --> 16:29.000
I gotta get home
and get my beauty sleep.
我得回家了
睡个美容觉。

16:29.068 --> 16:31.413
- Oh, what died
on that guy's neck?
- 哦，死了什么
在那家伙的脖子上？

16:31.482 --> 16:34.379
Oh, it's his head.
- Huh?
哦，这是他的头。
- 啊？

16:34.448 --> 16:38.965
Hey, what died on your neck?
Oh, it's your head.
嘿，你脖子上死了什么？
哦，这是你的头。

16:39.034 --> 16:42.241
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

16:42.310 --> 16:45.413
- Why, that little plagiarist.
That was my line!
- 哎呀，那个小抄袭者。
那是我的台词！

16:45.482 --> 16:46.655
- [laughs]
- [笑]

16:46.724 --> 16:48.793
Obviously the sleep
hasn't been helping!
明显是睡觉
一直没有帮忙！

16:48.862 --> 16:50.517
[laughs]
[笑]

16:50.586 --> 16:53.034
- Did-did I say that?
I didn't say that.
- 我有说过吗？
我没那么说。

16:53.103 --> 16:55.206
- [laughs]
Hey, do me.
- [笑]
嘿，做我吧。

16:55.275 --> 16:57.586
Insult me.
- All right.
侮辱我。
- 好的。

16:57.655 --> 16:59.689
Roses are red,
violets are blue,
玫瑰是红色的，
紫罗兰是蓝色的，

16:59.758 --> 17:02.689
I was born pretty,
what happened to you?
我生来就漂亮
你怎么了？

17:02.758 --> 17:05.689
- [laughs]
That was a good one.
- [笑]
那是一件好事。

17:05.758 --> 17:07.448
- Huh?
Whoa!
- 啊？
哇！

17:07.517 --> 17:11.310
- Chef Bob, we don't speak
like that to our customers.
- 鲍勃厨师，我们不说话
就像对我们的客户那样。

17:11.379 --> 17:14.689
- Me next!
Shoot me a zinger!
- 下一个是我！
给我开一枪！

17:14.758 --> 17:17.827
- Oh, I'm sorry.
I didn't get that.
- 哦，对不起。
我没明白。

17:17.896 --> 17:20.000
I don't speak goober!
我不会说脏话！

17:20.068 --> 17:22.655
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

17:22.724 --> 17:25.551
- I love it.
Guilty as charged.
- 我喜欢它。
被指控有罪。

17:25.620 --> 17:27.103
[laughs]
[笑]

17:27.172 --> 17:30.137
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

17:30.206 --> 17:32.655
[cheering]
[欢呼]

17:32.724 --> 17:35.689
- Oh, great.
I've created a monster.
- 哦，太好了。
我创造了一个怪物。

17:35.758 --> 17:39.551
A funny, talented monster.
一个有趣、才华横溢的怪物。

17:39.620 --> 17:40.862
- [laughing]
- [笑]

17:40.931 --> 17:42.620
Oh, I gotta hand it to you.
哦，我得把它交给你。

17:42.689 --> 17:46.896
That new insult comedy act is
really bringing in the money.
新的侮辱喜剧是
真正带来了钱。

17:46.965 --> 17:49.344
- Hmm.
- 唔。

17:49.413 --> 17:53.103
- Ah, what's this here?
- Sorry, Mr. Krabs.
- 啊，这是什么？
- 对不起，蟹老板。

17:53.172 --> 17:56.275
It's a list of things Chef Bob
needs for his dressing room.
这是厨师鲍勃的清单
需要他的更衣室。

17:56.344 --> 17:57.931
- Oh, does he?
- 哦，是吗？

17:58.000 --> 17:59.793
Fresh-cut seaweed,
鲜切海带，

17:59.862 --> 18:04.034
a manicurist for SpongeBob's
puppet hand--What?
海绵宝宝的美甲师
傀儡手——什么？

18:04.103 --> 18:06.413
A bigger dressing room?
更大的更衣室？

18:06.482 --> 18:09.137
- In the meantime, we'll just
take over your office,
- 与此同时，我们将
接管你的办公室，

18:09.206 --> 18:11.965
blubber boy.
- Blubber boy?
鲸脂男孩。
- 哭哭啼啼的男孩？

18:12.034 --> 18:13.586
Huh?
Oh.
啊？
哦。

18:13.655 --> 18:17.620
No way!
[grunting]
决不！
[咕噜声]

18:17.689 --> 18:19.379
[groans]
- What's the matter, Krabs?
[呻吟]
- 怎么了，蟹蟹？

18:19.448 --> 18:21.310
You don't like money?
- [groans]
你不喜欢钱？
- [呻吟]

18:21.379 --> 18:23.862
- What?
Of course I like money.
- 什么？
我当然喜欢钱。

18:23.931 --> 18:26.655
The office will be ready
in five minutes.
办公室将准备就绪
五分钟后。

18:26.724 --> 18:29.896
- Chef Bob, I think your
insults are mean and hurtful.
- 鲍勃厨师，我想你的
侮辱是卑鄙且有害的。

18:29.965 --> 18:32.655
What do you say we just go back
to the Krabby Patty routines,
你说怎么样我们就回去吧
蟹肉饼的做法，

18:32.724 --> 18:34.482
huh?
- Need I remind you that
嗯？
- 需要我提醒你吗

18:34.551 --> 18:38.000
my insults pay your salary?
我的侮辱可以支付你的工资吗？

18:38.068 --> 18:41.931
- Yes, sir.
I mean, no, sir.
- 是的，先生。
我的意思是，不，先生。

18:42.000 --> 18:45.172
- Chef Bob, you stole my line.
- 鲍勃厨师，你抢了我的台词。

18:45.241 --> 18:47.655
I do all the insults
around here.
所有的侮辱都是我做的
在这附近。

18:47.724 --> 18:51.034
- Oh, I am so sorry, Squidward.
- 哦，我很抱歉，章鱼哥。

18:51.103 --> 18:52.931
You're absolutely right.
你是绝对正确的。

18:53.000 --> 18:56.379
- Um, oh, well, uh, thank you.
- 嗯，哦，好吧，呃，谢谢。

18:56.448 --> 18:59.965
It's-it's-it's really
not such a big deal.
这这这这真是
没什么大不了的。

19:00.034 --> 19:02.758
- Let me make it up to you.
Hi, everybody!
- 让我来补偿你。
大家好！

19:02.827 --> 19:05.517
I'd like to introduce you
to a very good friend of mine.
我想向您介绍一下
给我的一个很好的朋友。

19:05.586 --> 19:09.620
Squidward Tentacles!
[cheers and applause]
章鱼哥的触手！
[欢呼和掌声]

19:09.689 --> 19:13.137
- Huh?
Oh, no, please, please.
- 啊？
哦，不，求你了，求你了。

19:13.206 --> 19:14.620
You're-you're too kind.
你、你太善良了。

19:14.689 --> 19:16.586
- I was gonna ask Squidward
how old he was,
-我本来想问章鱼哥
他几岁了，

19:16.655 --> 19:20.172
but then I remembered
he can't count that high.
但后来我想起来了
他不能算那么高。

19:20.241 --> 19:21.172
- Huh?
- 啊？

19:21.241 --> 19:23.965
[laughter]
[笑声]

19:28.241 --> 19:30.379
- Hmm?
[growls]
- 唔？
[咆哮]

19:30.448 --> 19:32.413
All right, that's it!
好吧，就是这样！

19:32.482 --> 19:35.000
You can't talk to Squidward
that way!
你不能和章鱼哥说话
那样！

19:35.068 --> 19:37.137
He is one of my best friends.
他是我最好的朋友之一。

19:37.206 --> 19:39.551
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

19:39.620 --> 19:41.965
- That's even more insulting.
——那就更侮辱人了。

19:42.034 --> 19:43.551
- Get a load of him, folks!
- 伙计们，让他来吧！

19:43.620 --> 19:46.068
He must've been born on a
highway because that's where
他一定是出生在
高速公路，因为那是哪里

19:46.137 --> 19:49.241
most accidents happen.
Yeah!
大多数事故都会发生。
是的！

19:49.310 --> 19:52.724
[clucking]
[laughter]
[咯咯笑]
[笑声]

19:52.793 --> 19:54.448
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

19:54.517 --> 19:56.896
- Ow!
- Not funny!
- 噢！
- 不好笑！

19:56.965 --> 19:59.517
[both shouting]
[两人大喊]

20:02.724 --> 20:06.241
[laughter]
[笑声]

20:06.310 --> 20:09.137
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

20:09.206 --> 20:11.758
- He scores!
- 他得分了！

20:11.827 --> 20:14.137
[chattering]
[喋喋不休]

20:14.206 --> 20:17.310
- Have a drink!
- [gasping]
- 喝一杯！
- [喘气]

20:17.379 --> 20:20.379
[gargling]
[漱口]

20:20.448 --> 20:24.896
- No, no!
[shouting]
- 不，不！
[喊叫]

20:26.793 --> 20:29.000
[all oohing]
[全都欢呼]

20:29.068 --> 20:30.758
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

20:30.827 --> 20:34.000
[both shouting]
[两人大喊]

20:34.068 --> 20:35.241
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

20:35.310 --> 20:36.793
- En garde!
- 准备好了！

20:36.862 --> 20:39.896
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

20:43.862 --> 20:47.034
[groaning]
[呻吟]

20:47.103 --> 20:49.103
- [laughing]
- [笑]

20:49.172 --> 20:52.448
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

20:52.517 --> 20:55.517
[all gasping]
[全都喘气]

20:57.103 --> 20:59.965
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

21:02.310 --> 21:05.206
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

21:05.275 --> 21:09.344
[both crying]
[两人都哭了]

21:09.413 --> 21:12.862
Oh! Ah! Ugh!
哦！啊!啊!

21:12.931 --> 21:14.344
[all muttering]
[大家嘀咕]

21:14.413 --> 21:17.172
- Me customers!
- 我的顾客！

21:17.241 --> 21:18.275
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

21:18.344 --> 21:20.068
- All right, enough of this.
- 好吧，够了。

21:20.137 --> 21:22.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

21:22.724 --> 21:27.758
Chef Bob,
you are hereby fired!
厨师鲍勃，
你特此被解雇！

21:27.827 --> 21:31.517
Mr. Squidward,
will you do the honors?
章鱼哥先生，
你愿意吗？

21:31.586 --> 21:33.206
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

21:33.275 --> 21:37.103
- Let me help you slip into
something more comfortable.
- 让我帮你滑进去
更舒服的东西。

21:37.172 --> 21:39.413
Like the gutter.
就像阴沟一样。

21:39.482 --> 21:42.413
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

21:42.482 --> 21:47.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:47.413 --> 21:48.758
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

21:48.827 --> 21:51.275
I learned a very valuable
lesson today.
我学到了非常宝贵的知识
今天的课。

21:51.344 --> 21:55.206
- To always be yourself
and not hide behind a puppet?
- 永远做你自己
而不是躲在傀儡后面？

21:55.275 --> 21:58.517
- Well, yeah, that, but mostly
don't slam your puppet hand
- 嗯，是的，但主要是这样
不要猛击你的木偶手

21:58.586 --> 22:00.551
in a register drawer.
在收银机抽屉里。

22:00.620 --> 22:02.758
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

22:02.827 --> 22:05.310
- [laughing]
- [笑]

22:05.379 --> 22:07.172
Ow.
噢。

22:07.241 --> 22:08.758
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

22:08.827 --> 22:10.931
both: What is it,
Mr. Squidward?
两者：这是什么，
章鱼哥先生？

22:11.000 --> 22:13.517
- It's-it's alive!
- 它 - 它还活着！

22:13.586 --> 22:15.103
- And now it's time for...
- 现在是时候了...

22:15.172 --> 22:17.551
"The Chef Bob
Cooking with Insults Show"!
“厨师鲍勃.
侮辱烹饪秀”！

22:17.620 --> 22:21.275
And here's your host,
Chef Bob!
这是你的主人，
厨师鲍勃！

22:21.344 --> 22:24.689
- Hi, everybody!
Who's hungry?
- 大家好！
谁饿了？

22:24.758 --> 22:26.965
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

22:27.034 --> 22:30.000
All right, roses are red,
violets are blue.
好吧，玫瑰是红色的，
紫罗兰是蓝色的。

22:30.068 --> 22:33.413
I was born pretty,
what happened to you?
我生来就漂亮
你怎么了？

22:33.482 --> 22:35.172
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

22:35.241 --> 22:37.310
- Yay, yeah!
- 是啊，是啊！

22:37.379 --> 22:39.655
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

22:46.344 --> 22:50.068
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

22:50.137 --> 22:54.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪